# =============================================================================
# .gitignore for the CBOE Options Analysis project
# =============================================================================
# Rule of thumb: keep code (src/, notebooks/), keep small results (results/),
# ignore raw data and derived data (data/), and ignore anything with licence
# restrictions or that GitHub would reject on size.

# -------- Raw and staged data (all licensed / oversized) ---------------------
# The full zip archive lives at the repo root; keep only the folder structure
CBOE_Data_2011_2026/
CBOE_Data_2011_2022/
CBOE_Data_2022_2026_new/
CBOE_Data_2022_2026/

# -------- Generated and licensed data ---------------------------------------
# Everything under data/ is either a licensed export (CBOE, IBES, CRSP) or a
# derived file produced by the pipeline. The pipeline rebuilds it from raw
# inputs, so it never belongs in the repo.
data/

# In case someone puts data at the repo root by mistake, ignore those too
/*.parquet
/*.csv
/*.zip

# -------- Python -------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.env

# -------- Jupyter -----------------------------------------------------------
# Notebook checkpoints — Jupyter's autosaves, never worth committing
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# -------- IDE / editor scratch ----------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# -------- Cached test / lint output -----------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# -------- Results ------------------------------------------------------------
# results/ IS committed — the tables and figures are small, and reviewers
# should see them without running the pipeline. Uncomment the next line if
# you want to keep results local only.
# results/

# But never commit anything oversized or that snuck in as an intermediate
results/*.parquet
results/*.zip
results/**/*.parquet

# -------- Personal / working files ------------------------------------------
# Scratch space for ad-hoc analysis that isn't meant to become part of the repo
scratch/
notes/
TODO.md
*.local.md
